==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)|Sanosuke Sagara]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

